        "text_copy_copy_27929": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "bottomPadding": "3",
          "jcr:createdBy": "user-1cc9f530da@example.invalid",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-98fdffe29c@example.invalid",
          "hideComponent": "false",
          "jcr:created": "Tue Jun 04 2024 16:22:57 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">Global perspectives on integrating arthroscopy and open hip preservation&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Sep 08 2026 23:10:20 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        },
        "text_copy_copy": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "user-1cc9f530da@example.invalid",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-98fdffe29c@example.invalid",
          "jcr:created": "Tue Jun 04 2024 16:22:57 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Thursday, October 8 |&nbsp;12:45-1:35 p.m.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Join a global panel of hip preservation experts for an interactive discussion on patient selection and decision-making across the full continuum of hip preservation care. Through real-world cases and expert discussion, learn the key considerations that guide decisions between isolated hip arthroscopy, combined hip arthroscopy with PAO, DFO, and other treatment strategies. The faculty will also share clinical outcomes, technical pearls and lessons learned to help optimize patient care.&nbsp;</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Moderator:&nbsp;</span></span><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Mike Ellman*</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Faculty:</span>&nbsp;Andrea Spiker*, Mario Hevesi*, Thomas Wuerz*, Juan Manuel Nossa*, Callum McBryde*, Brian Lewis*, Michael Salata*</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Sep 17 2026 16:57:30 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      },
      "col2": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "sling:resourceType": "wcm/foundation/components/parsys",
        "standaloneimage_copy_621558126": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "user-c26bb7a766@example.invalid",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-98fdffe29c@example.invalid",
          "preset": "max_width_1440",
          "jcr:created": "Mon Jun 02 2025 15:43:39 GMT+0000",
          "alt": "Hip anatomy illustration",
          "srcFileRef": "/content/dam/stryker/sports-medicine/campaigns/aossm/aossm-hip-tile-1200x680.png",
          "borderColor": "rgb(0,0,0)",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Fri May 29 2026 15:15:06 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/standaloneimage",
          "enableBorder": "true"
        },
        "text_copy_copy": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "bottomPadding": "3",
          "jcr:createdBy": "user-1cc9f530da@example.invalid",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-98fdffe29c@example.invalid",
          "hideComponent": "false",
          "jcr:created": "Tue Jun 04 2024 16:22:57 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">Contemporary approaches to hip capsular management and preservation&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Sep 08 2026 23:12:23 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        },
        "text_copy_copy_copy": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "user-1cc9f530da@example.invalid",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-98fdffe29c@example.invalid",
          "jcr:created": "Tue Jun 04 2024 16:22:57 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Friday, October 9 |&nbsp;12:45-1:55 p.m.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Gain practical insights into the evolving philosophies and decision-making that shape hip capsular management in modern hip preservation. Explore the latest evidence surrounding capsulotomy, capsular repair, plication, and reconstruction, including how patient anatomy, pathology, and instability influence treatment decisions. Faculty will also share clinical outcomes, surgical techniques, and practical pearls for enhancing capsular management in hip arthroscopy.&nbsp;</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Moderator: </span>Chad Mather*</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Faculty:</span>&nbsp;Alan Zhang*, Shane Nho*, Femi Ayeni*, Andrew Wolff*</span></li>\n</ul>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Sep 17 2026 16:57:47 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      }
    },
